# NutriSA — required environment variables. Copy to `.env.local` and fill in.
#
#   Copy-Item .env.example .env.local
#
# Values live in Supabase → Project Settings → API. The same two variables must be
# set in the Vercel project for Production, Preview and Development.
#
# The ANON key is public by design (Plan §2) and is meant to reach the browser.
# The service_role key is NEVER used by this app — not in a route handler, not in a
# script, not "just for a migration". If you find yourself wanting it, stop.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
